{"ID":"20250224130059-md2ayfs","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20250224130059-md2ayfs","title":"A4L3——列表","type":"doc","updated":"20250224130141"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224130059-k0jpwq9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20250224130059-k0jpwq9","updated":"20250224130141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"列表"}]},{"ID":"20250224130116-xbuy8ah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224130116-xbuy8ah","updated":"20250224130116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"u","TextMarkTextContent":"列表（list）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是一个抽象的数据结构概念，它表示元素的有序集合，支持元素访问、修改、添加、删除和遍历等操作，无须使用者考虑容量限制的问题。列表可以基于链表或数组实现。"}]},{"ID":"20250224130116-mfity6x","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20250224130116-mfity6x","updated":"20250224130116"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224130116-mn3ydaq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224130116-mn3ydaq","updated":"20250224130116"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224130116-1qpu2sm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224130116-1qpu2sm","updated":"20250224130116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"链表天然可以看作一个列表，其支持元素增删查改操作，并且可以灵活动态扩容。"}]}]},{"ID":"20250224130116-5uzfq68","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20250224130116-5uzfq68","updated":"20250224130116"},"Children":[{"ID":"20250224130116-x5m5ii2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224130116-x5m5ii2","updated":"20250224130116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"数组也支持元素增删查改，但由于其长度不可变，因此只能看作一个具有长度限制的列表。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20250224130116-nfhose0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224130116-nfhose0","updated":"20250224130116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当使用数组实现列表时，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"长度不可变的性质会导致列表的实用性降低"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这是因为我们通常无法事先确定需要存储多少数据，从而难以选择合适的列表长度。若长度过小，则很可能无法满足使用需求；若长度过大，则会造成内存空间浪费。"}]},{"ID":"20250224130116-8umdfur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224130116-8umdfur","updated":"20250224130116"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为解决此问题，我们可以使用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"u","TextMarkTextContent":"动态数组（dynamic array）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来实现列表。它继承了数组的各项优点，并且可以在程序运行过程中进行动态扩容。"}]},{"ID":"20250224130116-u5mvgrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20250224130116-u5mvgrl","updated":"20250224130141"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实际上，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"许多编程语言中的标准库提供的列表是基于动态数组实现的"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n例如 Python 中的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"list"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 、Java 中的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ArrayList"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 、C++ 中的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"vector"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 和 C# 中的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"List"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 等。\n在接下来的讨论中，我们将把“列表”和“动态数组”视为等同的概念。"}]}]}